      "has_more": false,
      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "Based on the warehouse ledger evidence: Received = 17 units (6+5+6), Dispatched = 23 units (8+5+6+4). The claim that Riverside dispatched more units than it received on 14 October is supported by the evidence (23 > 17). No other receipts or dispatches were recorded that day.",
          "content_hash": "0xc898dfa03e359170e2649466a7af5aa85cf173fb5fe122094933c07d04c57808",
          "created_at_ms": 1793230680476,
          "message_id": "18b6b1ef-346e-4168-bfa5-1d4f1efebb73",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-1",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Based on the warehouse ledger in the case file, Riverside received 17 units and dispatched 23 units on 14 October. This supports the claim that more units were dispatched than received. I will review any challenger evidence if a dispute is filed.",
          "content_hash": "0x588572a8f16ac54f61ad292be152f2d03de76f6d0740244908fcf1847fa926a3",
          "created_at_ms": 1793230721326,
          "message_id": "6d407ee9-e25e-40f1-b834-1f961c2da0b0",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-3",
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "The warehouse ledger shows 17 units received and 23 units dispatched on 14 October. The claim that Riverside dispatched more than it received is factually supported by this evidence. I await any challenger evidence, but absent a valid challenge the claim stands on the merits.",
          "content_hash": "0x3172b9450bf266a56b2bb0b3636a8c3c82d5ff2509749de7882691a566fb02b3",
